*Dear Soheil,*
First of all, thank you very much for your detailed reply and for taking
the time to answer all my questions.
I also sincerely appreciate the production video and the CPM Dreams fashion
show video. Thank you for sharing them with me. It was very interesting to
see your collection presented on the runway, as well as to get a better
understanding of your production.
Please accept my apologies for my delayed reply. I have been very busy over
the past week, so only now I have had the opportunity to respond properly.
Thank you as well for providing more information about your company and
your experience with the Russian market. Your answers were very helpful and
gave me a better understanding of Raspina Clothing.
I am still carefully reviewing your company profile, catalog, and the
videos you shared. I always prefer to learn as much as possible about a
manufacturer before discussing business opportunities.
I would also like to tell you a little more about my work.
I specialize in representing reliable foreign manufacturers in Russia and
helping them establish long-term business relationships with apparel
brands, retailers, wholesalers, and importers. My work is focused on
building long-term partnerships, so before introducing a manufacturer to
potential customers, I always take the time to understand the company's
production capabilities, strengths, quality standards, and overall business
approach.
From what I have seen so far, I believe Raspina has interesting potential,
and I would like to continue learning more about your company.
I have a few additional questions:
=E2=80=A2 Is your cooperation with Dyma LLC still ongoing, or was it a comp=
leted
project?
=E2=80=A2 What is your usual MOQ per style and per color?
=E2=80=A2 If a customer provides their own designs, technical packs, and
specifications, are you able to develop samples and manufacture according
to those requirements?
=E2=80=A2 Do you work only with locally sourced fabrics, or can you also so=
urce
fabrics according to customers' requirements?
=E2=80=A2 Do you have any quality certifications, social compliance audits,=
 or
fabric testing reports that you could share?
=E2=80=A2 I also noticed that your presentation mentions woven fabric
production, circular knitting production, and warp knitting production.
Could you please tell me whether these manufacturing processes are carried
out within your own facilities, or do you cooperate with partner mills?
I also appreciate your invitation for a video meeting. I think it would be
a great opportunity to get to know each other better. After I finish
reviewing all the materials and prepare my questions, I would be pleased to
arrange a meeting and discuss your company in more detail.
Thank you once again for your openness, professionalism, and prompt
communication. I look forward to your reply and hope this will be the
beginning of a successful long-term cooperation.
*Best regards,*
*Chulpan*


